        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-path-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "虚构记录：A图纸与物料表均为v4、零件匹配、公差合格且测试条件已批准并完整；B图纸v4但物料表v3；C测量值超上限；D测试隔离状态未知。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "electromechanical-equipment-assemblers.path.career-path-block.3",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-path-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "规则：版本、零件、公差和测试条件齐全才进入纸面放行；冲突隔离；超差返工评审；隔离未知暂停。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "electromechanical-equipment-assemblers.path.career-path-block.4",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-path-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "独立推演：A满足版本、零件、公差和测试条件全部要求，进入纸面放行；B版本冲突隔离；C超差进入返工评审；D隔离状态未知而暂停。四条守恒。"
            ]
          },
          "id": "electromechanical-equipment-assemblers.path.career-path-block.5",
          "source_refs": [
            "editorial"
          ],
          "type": "prose"
        },
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.career-path-block",
          "data": {
            "paragraphs": [
              "七天试验只用同一材料做核对、分流、记录和复盘。"
            ]
