      "items": [
        {
          "availability": "available",
          "copy_key": "career.item.faq-block",
          "data": {
            "entries": [
              {
                "answer": "核心工作包括读图纸规格、对准紧固零件、连接线缆管路、精密测量、检验测试并调整成品。",
                "id": "electromechanical-equipment-assemblers.faq.1",
                "question_key": "career.faq.electromechanical-equipment-assemblers.daily-work",
                "source_refs": [
                  "onet"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "装配工按规格形成实体组件；电子工程师负责设计，工程技术员支持开发测试，机器人技术员安装维护自动系统，校准岗位保障量值，维修工诊断修复已用设备。",
                "id": "electromechanical-equipment-assemblers.faq.2",
                "question_key": "career.faq.electromechanical-equipment-assemblers.role-comparison",
                "source_refs": [
                  "adj-cal",
                  "adj-eng",
                  "adj-repair",
                  "adj-robot",
                  "adj-tech",
                  "onet"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "适配证据来自能否读图、按序装配、精确测量、记录异常，并在图纸或测试条件不清时停手。",
                "id": "electromechanical-equipment-assemblers.faq.3",
                "question_key": "career.faq.electromechanical-equipment-assemblers.fit",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "AI可辅助检查物料表、工序版本和记录字段，但不能确认实物配合、公差、接线极性、扭矩或安全隔离。",
                "id": "electromechanical-equipment-assemblers.faq.4",
                "question_key": "career.faq.electromechanical-equipment-assemblers.ai-impact",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "人员必须对照图纸、实物、量具、测试方法和批准版本复核；工具不得自动放行成品或发出带电测试指令。",
                "id": "electromechanical-equipment-assemblers.faq.5",
                "question_key": "career.faq.electromechanical-equipment-assemblers.human-control",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "国家统计局2025年行业和人员类别工资材料未建立与O*NET 51-2023.00一一对应的中国全国单职业工资分布。",
                "id": "electromechanical-equipment-assemblers.faq.6",
                "question_key": "career.faq.electromechanical-equipment-assemblers.china-pay",
                "source_refs": [
                  "nbs"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "美国2025年合并职业数据：电气、电子和机电装配工合并口径年薪中位数45,850美元、时薪中位数22.04美元。",
                "id": "electromechanical-equipment-assemblers.faq.7",
                "question_key": "career.faq.electromechanical-equipment-assemblers.us-pay",
                "source_refs": [
                  "wage"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "入门证据应展示图纸拆解、物料核对、装配顺序、公差记录、缺陷分流和交接。",
                "id": "electromechanical-equipment-assemblers.faq.8",
                "question_key": "career.faq.electromechanical-equipment-assemblers.education-path",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "课程、工牌和岗位名称不自动授予带电测试、起重、校准签发、图纸变更或隔离解除权限。",
                "id": "electromechanical-equipment-assemblers.faq.9",
                "question_key": "career.faq.electromechanical-equipment-assemblers.credentials",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "图纸版本、零件标识、接线、公差、量具状态或测试隔离不清时不放行，保留原状并升级。",
                "id": "electromechanical-equipment-assemblers.faq.10",
                "question_key": "career.faq.electromechanical-equipment-assemblers.risk-boundary",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "美国合并职业数据预计就业由2024年261,400人增至2034年273,300人，增长5%，年均空缺29,600个。",
                "id": "electromechanical-equipment-assemblers.faq.11",
                "question_key": "career.faq.electromechanical-equipment-assemblers.outlook-transition",
                "source_refs": [
                  "trend"
                ]
              },
              {
                "answer": "是否值得进入应由纸面装配记录中的图纸核对、公差判断、缺陷分流和安全边界决定。",
                "id": "electromechanical-equipment-assemblers.faq.12",
                "question_key": "career.faq.electromechanical-equipment-assemblers.career-worth",
                "source_refs": [
                  "editorial"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "id": "electromechanical-equipment-assemblers.sources.faq.1",
